<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech stats bureau sees higher 1996 sugar harvest.</title>
<headline>Czech stats bureau sees higher 1996 sugar harvest.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech Statistical Bureau on Monday forecast the country's 1996 sugar beet harvest to total 4.221 million tonnes, compared with 3.712 million tonnes in 1995.</p>
<p> CZECH SUGAR BEETS		1996 (EST)	   1995</p>
<p>  total harvest(million tonnes)     4.221		3.712</p>
<p>  yield (tonnes/per hectare)   40.550	     39.860</p>
<p>  hectares sown		   104,115	     93,104</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
